{%- liquid
  assign section_id = section.id

  comment
    The article page.

    The hero (region A, the `title` block) is a full-bleed two-panel split and
    the body (region B, the `content` block) is a 1264 measure with its own
    88/16 gutter, so NEITHER can sit inside a shared `.shopify-page-width`
    wrapper the way this section used to render them — the wrapper and its
    858px inner cap are gone, and every block owns its own width and padding.

    `share`, `featured_image` and `tags` are not in the design. They stay
    available as block types and keep a page-width inset of their own so they
    still render sensibly if a merchant adds one.

    No required settings: `article.title` and `article.content` always exist on
    an article template, so this section never withholds itself.
  endcomment
-%}

{%- style -%}
  #article-{{ section_id }} {
    --article-fg-color: {{ section.settings.fg_color | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --article-bg-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color | default: '#222222' }};

    {%- if section.settings.color_mode == 'custom' -%}
      color: var(--article-fg-color);
      background: var(--article-bg-color);
    {%- else -%}
      color: var(--color-foreground);
      background: var(--color-background);
    {%- endif -%}
  }

  /* Every region abuts the next — a 0px gap between all four, with all the
     vertical air coming from each region's own padding. */
  #article-{{ section_id }} .article__regions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  #article-{{ section_id }} .article__inset {
    padding-block: 2rem;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div id="article-{{ section_id }}" class="article">
  <div class="article__regions">
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- case block.type -%}
        {%- when 'title' -%}
          {%- render 'article-title', block: block -%}

        {%- when 'content' -%}
          {%- render 'article-content', block: block -%}

        {%- when 'share' -%}
          <div class="article__inset shopify-page-width shopify-page-padding">
            {%- render 'article-share', block: block -%}
          </div>

        {%- when 'featured_image' -%}
          <div class="article__inset shopify-page-width shopify-page-padding">
            {%- render 'article-featured-image', block: block -%}
          </div>

        {%- when 'tags' -%}
          <div class="article__inset shopify-page-width shopify-page-padding">
            {%- render 'article-tags', block: block -%}
          </div>
      {%- endcase -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</div>

